  "notes": "Two sites. 216 routes: a100-gpu-vm-002, 12 Nov 2026, Paddock f873bc2, alpamayo2-edge 02f55a7, Bench2Drive 7ec25d1 + patches 0001-0002 (record full220-836dda734659a86c-56db50). Routes 3800, 11715, 23695 and 24071, set aside there for every model, driven later at b2d-fill-fastcode-shakaal (one RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell), 14 Nov 2026, Paddock f873bc2 (the 216 routes' commit, so the same model.yaml env), alpamayo2-edge 02f55a7, Bench2Drive 7ec25d1 + patches 0001-0003: patch 0003 removes a flow car 600 m from the hero before a large map puts it to sleep. Same settings as the 216: 10 Hz (planning_hz), waypoint_dt 0.5, early stop 30 s / 3 m + 4x Think2Drive's time, paddock's rig, model.yaml's env (frames nearest, history hermite, one sample, seed 43), no site env, PADDOCK_INFER_TIMEOUT_S 600, up to three attempts a route. of the 220 routes pooled: 4 route(s) from 1 run(s) under `runs`, read from their results.json (sites recorded: none); 216 route(s) from tracked record bench2drive/alpamayo2edge/full220-836dda734659a86c-56db50, read from its upstream_scores.json (sha256 42b563edc230; pooled at site a100-gpu-vm-002, its runs' sites recorded: none). A route scored under `runs` takes precedence over a record's row. duration_s, the evaluator's wall-clock seconds, is not in upstream_scores.json, so the 216 route(s) from tracked records carry none and metrics.json counts them missing, as for a route --resume reused. 1 of 1 source runs kept no run.json, so their routes are attributed to alpamayo2edge on the tree they were found in; config.model_env and the rest of config are what 1/1 source runs recorded. asked for a plan at 10 Hz, the planning_hz the model's model.yaml declared for these runs, the last plan followed in between. early stop (30 s without 3 m of route progress or 4x the expert's time on the route (none on the 9 route(s) here with no expert drive)): a car in a driving scene is expected to move, to finish in reasonable time and not to collide, so a route ended this way is a failed drive, scored as it stood when it ended (a collision's penalty included).",
